sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM Engine<br/>ZMQ Publisher
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Subscriber<br/>tcp://:5557
    participant Workers as Worker Pool<br/>(4 workers)
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>KV Block Index
    participant Online as Online Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as llm-d EPP<br/>(Routing Layer)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PodRecon as PodReconciler<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Tokenizer as UDS Tokenizer<br/>gRPC over UDS
    participant ColocSvc as Co-located Service
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector

    Note over vLLM,Redis: Flow 1: KV Cache Event Ingestion

    vLLM->>ZMQ: Publish KV event (store/delete/clear)<br/>topic: kv@
    ZMQ->>Workers: Dispatch event
    Workers->>Redis: Update KV block index<br/>(prefix hash → pod ID + block metadata)
    Redis-->>Workers: ACK

    Note over EPP,Redis: Flow 2: Prefix Scoring Request

    EPP->>Online: POST /score_completions<br/>or /score_chat_completions<br/>HTTP/8080, No Auth
    Online->>Redis: Query prefix match scores<br/>for all indexed pods
    Redis-->>Online: Per-pod block match data
    Online-->>EPP: JSON response with<br/>ranked pod scores

    Note over K8sAPI,Redis: Flow 3: Pod Lifecycle Tracking

    K8sAPI-->>PodRecon: Watch event: Pod added/removed<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount auth
    PodRecon->>Redis: Update pod availability<br/>in KV cache index

    Note over ColocSvc,Tokenizer: Flow 4: Tokenization (Local Only)

    ColocSvc->>Tokenizer: gRPC: Tokenize / RenderChatCompletion<br/>UDS: /tmp/tokenizer/tokenizer-uds.socket<br/>Auth: filesystem perms (0700)
    Tokenizer-->>ColocSvc: Tokenized result

    Note over Online,OTel: Flow 5: Observability Export

    Online->>OTel: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC
